1
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:19,320
[Eight years ago]

2
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:18,550
Come in.

3
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:24,510
Mom.

4
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:27,120
Come on.

5
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:27,960
Mom.

6
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:29,270
Feiyan, you're back.

7
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:32,180
Come.

8
00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:34,070
Slow down.

9
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:35,280
Who is this?

10
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:38,110
This is the one

11
00:00:38,670 --> 00:00:39,980
I often mentioned to you,

12
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:40,830
the young master of the Wang family,

13
00:00:40,830 --> 00:00:41,630
Wang Jiaxian.

14
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:42,640
Jiaxian.

15
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:46,380
Go pour some tea.

16
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:48,710
Have a seat.

17
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:49,390
Jiaxian.

18
00:00:49,930 --> 00:00:50,400
Come.

19
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:51,350
Sit.

20
00:00:56,150 --> 00:00:56,680
Jiaxian,

21
00:00:57,360 --> 00:00:59,280
Feiyan has had a hard life.

22
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:02,390
She may look glamorous on stage,

23
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:03,680
but off stage,

24
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:05,430
she still has to make a living

25
00:01:05,430 --> 00:01:07,510
by pleasing others every day.

26
00:01:08,350 --> 00:01:09,840
She is all alone,

27
00:01:10,150 --> 00:01:11,350
with no one to rely on.

28
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:13,400
After she met you,

29
00:01:14,050 --> 00:01:14,930
only then

30
00:01:15,310 --> 00:01:17,310
does she have something to live for.

31
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:19,640
Mom,

32
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:21,230
don't say that.

33
00:01:22,150 --> 00:01:22,710
Here.

34
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:26,170
Easy, easy.

35
00:01:32,070 --> 00:01:32,640
Mom.

36
00:01:32,870 --> 00:01:33,580
I'll go get a doctor.

37
00:01:33,580 --> 00:01:34,270
I'll go.

38
00:01:34,930 --> 00:01:35,520
Don't go.

39
00:01:36,410 --> 00:01:37,970
I don't have much time left.

40
00:01:38,710 --> 00:01:40,170
Don't waste any more money

41
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:41,759
on my illness.

42
00:01:43,229 --> 00:01:43,710
Sit.

43
00:01:45,950 --> 00:01:46,479
Mom.

44
00:01:47,430 --> 00:01:49,509
My illness has dragged you down.

45
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:50,840
Don't say that.

46
00:01:51,310 --> 00:01:52,970
This kid is so strong-willed.

47
00:01:53,350 --> 00:01:54,950
She bears all the suffering

48
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,800
and hardships by herself.

49
00:01:57,860 --> 00:01:59,460
She never tells me anything.

50
00:01:59,710 --> 00:02:00,280
Mom.

51
00:02:01,710 --> 00:02:02,560
Jiaxian.

52
00:02:03,790 --> 00:02:04,450
From now on,

53
00:02:04,870 --> 00:02:06,600
I'll leave Feiyan in your care.

54
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,750
I hope you take good care of her.

55
00:02:10,310 --> 00:02:11,110
Rest assured.

56
00:02:13,750 --> 00:02:15,950
I will definitely take good care of her.

57
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,030
Good.

58
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,150
Good.

59
00:02:21,470 --> 00:02:22,470
I always thought

60
00:02:22,710 --> 00:02:23,840
this day would come.

61
00:02:25,430 --> 00:02:26,630
But I didn't expect it

62
00:02:27,079 --> 00:02:28,190
to come so soon.

63
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,120
Do it.

64
00:02:30,610 --> 00:02:31,560
I won't say

65
00:02:32,130 --> 00:02:33,260
a word of complaint.

66
00:02:33,820 --> 00:02:34,780
No rush.

67
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:38,640
Just put on an act with me for now.

68
00:02:40,010 --> 00:02:41,470
If you don't kill me today,

69
00:02:42,180 --> 00:02:44,040
aren't you afraid I'll report you

70
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:44,970
to Hu Guangyuan?

71
00:02:47,430 --> 00:02:48,310
You won't.

72
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:52,170
Hu is still waiting
for his grandma to return.

73
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:58,079
I'm just a lonely old woman.

74
00:02:58,100 --> 00:03:00,620
I've never heard of such a child.

75
00:03:01,050 --> 00:03:02,390
You're trying to fool me,

76
00:03:02,390 --> 00:03:03,590
but you're too green.

77
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:08,790
You hid your grandson well,

78
00:03:09,430 --> 00:03:11,630
but with his congenital tuberculosis,

79
00:03:11,820 --> 00:03:14,550
he still needs to get his medicine
on time, right?

80
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:16,000
What did you do to Hu?

81
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:19,770
So scammers have feelings too.

82
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:30,240
When you went after

83
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,500
my brother and sister,

84
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:33,880
why didn't you show any mercy?

85
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:37,630
Is Hu...

86
00:03:40,750 --> 00:03:42,280
still alive?

87
00:03:47,470 --> 00:03:48,710
I'm not like you.

88
00:03:50,230 --> 00:03:52,090
Families shouldn't be involved.

89
00:03:54,310 --> 00:03:55,710
The barefoot doctor you found

90
00:03:55,710 --> 00:03:57,050
only treats symptoms
but not the root cause.

91
00:03:57,050 --> 00:03:59,910
I've found a doctor
who specializes in tuberculosis.

92
00:03:59,910 --> 00:04:02,060
When you and your grandson meet again,

93
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:04,170
maybe you'll see

94
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,520
a lively and healthy Hu.

95
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,360
But before that,

96
00:04:09,070 --> 00:04:11,400
you have to play along
with me for this act.

97
00:04:12,150 --> 00:04:13,190
Where

98
00:04:13,590 --> 00:04:15,190
is Hu now?

99
00:04:20,089 --> 00:04:21,290
After it's done,

100
00:04:23,470 --> 00:04:25,030
I will tell you.

101
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:09,740
[A Prophet]

102
00:06:10,420 --> 00:06:12,570
[Episode 2]

103
00:06:21,880 --> 00:06:23,390
Then I'll go back to the hotel.

104
00:06:23,390 --> 00:06:24,150
Shengxiang,

105
00:06:24,470 --> 00:06:26,400
keep Miss Chen company for a while.

106
00:06:27,640 --> 00:06:28,120
Mom,

107
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:29,810
you go back and rest.

108
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:31,150
I'll be back

109
00:06:31,730 --> 00:06:32,620
in a bit.

110
00:06:33,409 --> 00:06:34,060
Okay.

111
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:36,570
Goodbye, Ma'am.

112
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:37,470
Goodbye.

113
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,390
Actually,

114
00:06:40,790 --> 00:06:42,880
you already knew
I was Lin Shengxiang, didn't you?

115
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:43,390
Yes.

116
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:45,390
Then why didn't you expose me?

117
00:06:45,390 --> 00:06:47,680
Because I think you're very interesting.

118
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:48,740
Most importantly,

119
00:06:48,830 --> 00:06:50,030
I also wanted to know

120
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:51,850
if the dignified Mr. Lin

121
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:54,290
had any special way of hitting on women.

122
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:57,520
So,

123
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,520
is there any difference?

124
00:07:02,230 --> 00:07:03,760
You tell stories very well.

125
00:07:06,150 --> 00:07:06,750
By the way,

126
00:07:07,590 --> 00:07:08,790
you haven't finished

127
00:07:08,830 --> 00:07:10,090
telling me that story.

128
00:07:30,230 --> 00:07:30,960
Jiaxian.

129
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:33,560
Stepmother.

130
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:34,090
Brother.

131
00:07:34,150 --> 00:07:34,470
Aunt.

132
00:07:34,470 --> 00:07:34,880
Jialiang, Jiashu.

133
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:35,640
Have a seat.

134
00:07:38,390 --> 00:07:39,320
The old man...

135
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:40,690
didn't come?

136
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,270
It's your father.

137
00:07:43,270 --> 00:07:44,330
Don't you know him?

138
00:07:44,470 --> 00:07:46,320
He tore up the wedding invitation
right away.

139
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:47,440
He also ordered that no one

140
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:49,120
should attend the wedding.

141
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:52,050
Otherwise, they would be kicked out
of the house.

142
00:07:52,150 --> 00:07:53,210
Then how did you...

143
00:07:53,390 --> 00:07:55,640
You've called me Stepmother
for over 10 years.

144
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:57,300
I have to come, no matter what.

145
00:07:57,830 --> 00:07:59,350
Just don't let him know.

146
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:00,390
You two,

147
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,250
don't talk nonsense when we get back.

148
00:08:02,250 --> 00:08:03,980
Brother, we won't tell Dad.

149
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:04,790
Good girl.

150
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:05,650
Jiaxian,

151
00:08:06,030 --> 00:08:06,940
the auspicious time is almost here.

152
00:08:06,940 --> 00:08:07,510
Let's go.

153
00:08:07,760 --> 00:08:08,120
Okay.

154
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:09,370
I almost forgot.

155
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:10,360
Take this.

156
00:08:10,610 --> 00:08:12,740
You two must live a good life together.

157
00:08:14,020 --> 00:08:15,480
Don't worry, Stepmother.

158
00:08:25,730 --> 00:08:29,280
♪ As sleeves rise and fall,
you glance is breathtaking ♪

159
00:08:29,300 --> 00:08:33,470
♪ You brush the dust away,
staying just for me ♪

160
00:08:33,490 --> 00:08:38,150
♪ I sing of spring on stage;
our eyes meet down below ♪

161
00:08:38,179 --> 00:08:41,150
♪ Our hearts silently align ♪

162
00:08:38,470 --> 00:08:39,559
The auspicious time has arrived.

163
00:08:39,559 --> 00:08:40,510
Bride and groom,

164
00:08:40,799 --> 00:08:42,039
first bow to heaven and earth!

165
00:08:42,039 --> 00:08:42,559
Great!

166
00:08:42,559 --> 00:08:43,750
-Great!
-Great!

167
00:08:43,150 --> 00:08:46,810
♪ I once sighed that
all love in plays was but fiction ♪

168
00:08:44,159 --> 00:08:45,800
Second bow to the parents!

169
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:47,440
-Great!
-Great!

170
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:50,490
♪ Now I know, amid crowds,
you'll grow old with me ♪

171
00:08:48,990 --> 00:08:50,510
Bow to each other!

172
00:08:51,170 --> 00:08:55,740
♪ Today I shed stage paint,
donning phoenix crown and red gown ♪

173
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:59,420
♪ To meet your tender love ♪

174
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:02,460
♪ You lift my veil and gaze into my eyes ♪

175
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:05,440
♪ I bow softly,
toasting our years like wine ♪

176
00:09:05,460 --> 00:09:07,460
♪ On this blessed, auspicious day ♪

177
00:09:07,490 --> 00:09:11,670
♪ I'll wait for you,
with a grand bridal procession ♪

178
00:09:08,590 --> 00:09:10,080
Is the bride beautiful?

179
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:11,740
-Beautiful!
-Beautiful!

180
00:09:12,870 --> 00:09:14,270
What are you waiting for?

181
00:09:14,400 --> 00:09:15,830
Hurry up and put it on me.

182
00:09:17,090 --> 00:09:21,480
♪ I bid wind and snow farewell,
set my opera robes aside, and run to you ♪

183
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,710
Groom, Wang Jiaxian,

184
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:21,600
and Bride, Jiang Feiyan.

185
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:25,470
♪ We braided hair and tied our knots;
you could hold me close ♪

186
00:09:21,870 --> 00:09:23,320
A happy marriage.

187
00:09:23,510 --> 00:09:24,750
A match made in heaven.

188
00:09:24,750 --> 00:09:25,920
May they grow old together.

189
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:29,230
♪ Red candles line the hall,
with wedding emblems intertwined ♪

190
00:09:26,160 --> 00:09:28,490
May their hearts be joined as one forever.

191
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:34,230
♪ With blushing cheeks,
I entrust you my whole life ♪

192
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:34,680
I had its band resized.

193
00:09:34,990 --> 00:09:35,470
Try it on.

194
00:09:35,070 --> 00:09:39,120
♪ I greet spring breeze, light
bright lamps, still waiting for you ♪

195
00:09:36,350 --> 00:09:37,320
But you've worn

196
00:09:38,280 --> 00:09:39,510
this watch for many years, right?

197
00:09:39,150 --> 00:09:42,800
♪ Lift the red silk and hand
our wedding quilt; can you see me? ♪

198
00:09:42,830 --> 00:09:46,720
♪ Through all worldly splendors,
I guard this warm moment ♪

199
00:09:44,230 --> 00:09:46,230
No matter what happened in the past,

200
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:47,230
from now on,

201
00:09:46,950 --> 00:09:51,970
♪ Dawn and dusk,
we live in harmony year on year ♪

202
00:09:47,710 --> 00:09:49,280
every minute and second

203
00:09:50,750 --> 00:09:51,710
belongs to us.

204
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:02,090
Jialiang, look.

205
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:02,750
This

206
00:10:02,990 --> 00:10:04,450
is a birthday gift for you.

207
00:10:04,470 --> 00:10:05,470
Your brother said

208
00:10:05,510 --> 00:10:06,710
you like crickets the most.

209
00:10:06,710 --> 00:10:07,110
Look,

210
00:10:07,350 --> 00:10:08,040
open it,

211
00:10:08,160 --> 00:10:09,420
and you can put them in.

212
00:10:10,920 --> 00:10:11,920
So pretty.

213
00:10:12,470 --> 00:10:13,980
Thank you, Sister-in-Law.

214
00:10:13,980 --> 00:10:15,720
Sister-in-Law, I want a gift too.

215
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:16,600
I want one too.

216
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:18,090
You want one too?

217
00:10:18,870 --> 00:10:19,550
How about this?

218
00:10:19,550 --> 00:10:21,570
I'll make one for you
in the next few days.

219
00:10:21,570 --> 00:10:22,050
Okay?

220
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:22,720
Okay.

221
00:10:23,920 --> 00:10:25,760
Longevity noodles are here!

222
00:10:25,780 --> 00:10:26,630
Noodles are here.

223
00:10:26,630 --> 00:10:27,320
Time to eat.

224
00:10:29,110 --> 00:10:31,110
Freshly cooked longevity noodles.

225
00:10:31,920 --> 00:10:32,560
Here.

226
00:10:33,630 --> 00:10:36,090
Let's serve a bowl
to our birthday boy first.

227
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:39,320
Add some soup.

228
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:41,230
Here, Birthday Boy.

229
00:10:42,710 --> 00:10:44,440
Sister-in-Law, you eat first.

230
00:10:46,630 --> 00:10:48,290
Sister-in-Law, here you are.

231
00:10:55,470 --> 00:10:56,000
Alright.

232
00:10:56,040 --> 00:10:58,350
The second bowl is for our birthday boy.

233
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:01,590
Get some soup.

234
00:11:03,110 --> 00:11:04,570
Here you go, Birthday Boy.

235
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,270
Chopsticks.

236
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:10,160
I'll give you the third bowl, okay?

237
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:10,750
Okay.

238
00:11:13,280 --> 00:11:14,110
And then what?

239
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:16,350
That's it.

240
00:11:17,920 --> 00:11:18,920
That's all?

241
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:20,920
A wedding night.

242
00:11:21,110 --> 00:11:22,080
Deeply in love,

243
00:11:22,400 --> 00:11:24,060
lovers finally tied the knot.

244
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:26,770
Isn't this the perfect ending?

245
00:11:27,830 --> 00:11:30,290
It feels like
there were no twists and turns.

246
00:11:31,920 --> 00:11:34,120
Why do you need so many twists and turns?

247
00:11:35,040 --> 00:11:36,120
In this life,

248
00:11:36,990 --> 00:11:38,920
isn't living peacefully to the end

249
00:11:40,470 --> 00:11:41,630
the happiest thing?

250
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:43,320
True.

251
00:12:19,590 --> 00:12:20,680
Behave yourself.

252
00:12:21,110 --> 00:12:22,310
Where is your mother?

253
00:12:22,870 --> 00:12:24,200
Speak! He's asking you!

254
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:25,280
I don't know.

255
00:12:25,830 --> 00:12:27,860
We separated after she got in the car.

256
00:12:27,860 --> 00:12:29,900
Why are you playing dumb with me?

257
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,440
I'm asking you where she is!

258
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:33,320
I was with Miss Chen all night.

259
00:12:34,110 --> 00:12:36,110
Didn't you send someone to spy on me?

260
00:12:36,230 --> 00:12:37,560
Just ask him.

261
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:40,350
No.

262
00:12:40,740 --> 00:12:43,340
You had dinner with Old Madam Zhu tonight.

263
00:12:44,160 --> 00:12:45,320
But on the way home,

264
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:47,350
you suddenly changed rickshaws, right?

265
00:12:47,350 --> 00:12:48,750
Then you entered the downtown area

266
00:12:48,750 --> 00:12:49,920
and disappeared.

267
00:12:50,470 --> 00:12:51,200
Where is she?

268
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:53,320
I'm asking you where she is!

269
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,040
Where is she?

270
00:12:54,040 --> 00:12:54,990
As for her whereabouts,

271
00:12:54,990 --> 00:12:57,110
go ask her. How would I know?

272
00:12:57,400 --> 00:12:58,510
Anyway, you know

273
00:12:58,590 --> 00:12:59,630
the rules.

274
00:13:00,560 --> 00:13:02,510
Defectors face certain death.

275
00:13:02,870 --> 00:13:04,870
This had better
have nothing to do with you.

276
00:13:04,870 --> 00:13:06,600
Otherwise, no one can save you.

277
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:07,800
Got...

278
00:13:08,560 --> 00:13:09,230
got it.

279
00:13:14,260 --> 00:13:14,810
Gui.

280
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:16,720
Let him answer the phone.

281
00:13:18,110 --> 00:13:18,910
Go over there.

282
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:23,600
Hello?

283
00:13:24,350 --> 00:13:26,080
Shengxiang, this is Qingying.

284
00:13:26,680 --> 00:13:28,350
About Song Tiezui you were looking for,

285
00:13:28,350 --> 00:13:30,350
my daddy asked around and found him.

286
00:13:30,680 --> 00:13:31,280
Really?

287
00:13:32,350 --> 00:13:34,830
Come to my house at 2:00 p.m. tomorrow,

288
00:13:35,160 --> 00:13:36,560
then I'll take you there.

289
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:38,230
But that Song Tiezui

290
00:13:38,350 --> 00:13:40,160
will only give us half an hour,

291
00:13:40,350 --> 00:13:41,880
so you should prepare well.

292
00:13:42,100 --> 00:13:43,430
Okay. See you tomorrow.

293
00:13:43,760 --> 00:13:44,760
See you tomorrow.

294
00:13:50,530 --> 00:13:51,590
They took the bait.

295
00:13:52,390 --> 00:13:53,100
[Chen Residence]

296
00:13:59,160 --> 00:14:00,200
Please wait here.

297
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:01,660
I'll go get the young lady.

298
00:14:04,990 --> 00:14:05,680
Master,

299
00:14:06,110 --> 00:14:08,070
Lin Shengxiang is new here.

300
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:10,110
Even if he is the son
of a wealthy merchant,

301
00:14:10,110 --> 00:14:12,370
we don't need to bother
with his trivial matters

302
00:14:12,370 --> 00:14:13,970
and go to such great lengths.

303
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:19,440
He's just a fledgling.

304
00:14:19,750 --> 00:14:22,040
He thinks leaving his father's control

305
00:14:22,230 --> 00:14:25,090
means he can achieve
great things in the vast world.

306
00:14:26,300 --> 00:14:28,000
The more eager he is for success,

307
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:30,050
the more advantageous it is for us.

308
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:34,200
Shengxiang,

309
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:36,110
have you met that Song Tiezui?

310
00:14:37,040 --> 00:14:37,680
No.

311
00:14:38,520 --> 00:14:41,250
I've only heard my father
tell stories about him.

312
00:14:43,590 --> 00:14:44,990
To tell you the truth,

313
00:14:46,040 --> 00:14:46,990
these

314
00:14:47,400 --> 00:14:49,460
so-called fortune-telling masters

315
00:14:49,870 --> 00:14:52,470
are basically packaged charlatans,

316
00:14:52,550 --> 00:14:54,040
full of nonsense.

317
00:14:54,750 --> 00:14:56,230
You are still young.

318
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:58,540
It's best not to get caught up in that.

319
00:14:59,160 --> 00:15:00,710
In the fortune-telling business,

320
00:15:00,710 --> 00:15:02,510
there are indeed many scammers.

321
00:15:02,810 --> 00:15:04,120
But this Master Song

322
00:15:04,590 --> 00:15:06,230
is a genuine master.

323
00:15:07,710 --> 00:15:09,040
What makes you say that?

324
00:15:17,160 --> 00:15:17,840
Uncle Chen.

325
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:19,920
I'm sorry.

326
00:15:20,110 --> 00:15:21,280
I apologize for my rudeness.

327
00:15:21,280 --> 00:15:23,280
Sorry to keep you all waiting.

328
00:15:25,040 --> 00:15:26,920
You must be President Chen.

329
00:15:27,400 --> 00:15:29,000
I've heard so much about you.

330
00:15:29,110 --> 00:15:30,470
I've long heard of your great name.

331
00:15:30,470 --> 00:15:31,630
After I see you today,

332
00:15:31,630 --> 00:15:33,680
you truly live up to your reputation.

333
00:15:33,680 --> 00:15:34,680
You flatter me.

334
00:15:34,830 --> 00:15:36,990
I am just a wanderer.

335
00:15:37,060 --> 00:15:38,460
And you are?

336
00:15:39,990 --> 00:15:40,990
This is—

337
00:15:40,990 --> 00:15:41,710
Mr. Song,

338
00:15:42,510 --> 00:15:44,080
this is my Four Pillars of Destiny.

339
00:15:44,080 --> 00:15:45,810
Please perform some readings.

340
00:15:47,590 --> 00:15:49,090
This is your Four Pillars of Destiny?

341
00:15:49,090 --> 00:15:49,610
Yes.

342
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:53,320
According to my readings,

343
00:15:53,990 --> 00:15:54,630
you are

344
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:56,920
not a local.

345
00:15:57,750 --> 00:16:01,320
And your father is a wealthy man.

346
00:16:09,330 --> 00:16:11,080
My father is obsessed
with the divination arts of the "I Ching."

347
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:12,140
Influenced by him,

348
00:16:12,430 --> 00:16:15,080
I also know a little
about the Four Pillars and physiognomy.

349
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:16,280
Recently, there is a matter

350
00:16:16,280 --> 00:16:17,590
that has been bothering me
for a long time.

351
00:16:17,590 --> 00:16:19,870
I can't figure it out,
no matter how hard I think.

352
00:16:19,870 --> 00:16:22,070
Could you please give me some guidance?

353
00:16:22,230 --> 00:16:22,920
Go ahead.

354
00:16:23,230 --> 00:16:24,630
According to ancient books,

355
00:16:24,630 --> 00:16:25,560
a broad forehead

356
00:16:25,560 --> 00:16:26,560
and a full‑rounded chin

357
00:16:26,560 --> 00:16:27,710
are signs of good fortune.

358
00:16:27,710 --> 00:16:29,560
To judge a person's wealth,
look at their nose.

359
00:16:29,560 --> 00:16:30,470
With a high bridge,

360
00:16:30,470 --> 00:16:31,440
a fleshy nose

361
00:16:31,560 --> 00:16:33,620
indicates a life of wealth and honor.

362
00:16:33,830 --> 00:16:36,230
But I see many mediocre people
on the street

363
00:16:36,350 --> 00:16:38,890
who have broad foreheads
and full‑rounded chins.

364
00:16:38,890 --> 00:16:40,130
And for dock workers

365
00:16:40,230 --> 00:16:41,330
and rickshaw pullers,

366
00:16:41,330 --> 00:16:43,130
many of them also have big noses.

367
00:16:43,470 --> 00:16:44,350
Why is that?

368
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:45,630
Physiognomy

369
00:16:45,630 --> 00:16:48,110
is based on Metal, Wood,
Water, Fire, and Earth.

370
00:16:48,110 --> 00:16:49,200
For the Five Elements,

371
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:50,530
the key is integration.

372
00:16:50,710 --> 00:16:52,740
Without integration,
if you judge just one part,

373
00:16:52,740 --> 00:16:54,470
how can you tell good or bad luck?

374
00:16:54,470 --> 00:16:55,880
Combining the Five Elements

375
00:16:55,880 --> 00:16:57,170
is the right way.

376
00:16:58,350 --> 00:16:58,920
Master,

377
00:16:59,220 --> 00:17:00,580
I have a favor to ask.

378
00:17:00,910 --> 00:17:01,660
My father

379
00:17:01,680 --> 00:17:03,870
wants to invest in minerals here.

380
00:17:04,030 --> 00:17:05,510
But there are many minerals here,

381
00:17:05,510 --> 00:17:07,310
and we don't know where to start.

382
00:17:07,329 --> 00:17:08,990
Please give us some guidance.

383
00:17:09,599 --> 00:17:12,599
Divination is about
revealing the secrets of heaven.

384
00:17:12,599 --> 00:17:14,050
It can't be done lightly.

385
00:17:14,069 --> 00:17:17,200
But since we met here,

386
00:17:17,230 --> 00:17:18,510
it's fate.

387
00:17:18,530 --> 00:17:19,240
I

388
00:17:19,510 --> 00:17:20,880
will do my best.

389
00:17:23,990 --> 00:17:24,750
Sir,

390
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:27,890
I can't go into details about this.

391
00:17:28,160 --> 00:17:30,440
But you must remember

392
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:31,920
a few words.

393
00:17:44,090 --> 00:17:44,850
All right.

394
00:17:45,070 --> 00:17:46,070
Time is up.

395
00:17:46,090 --> 00:17:47,850
Please leave.

396
00:17:52,330 --> 00:17:53,120
Uncle Chen.

397
00:17:57,230 --> 00:17:58,360
East of Mount Ping.

398
00:17:58,380 --> 00:18:00,100
North of the Hao River.

399
00:18:00,300 --> 00:18:01,850
Where the mountain ends, silver appears.

400
00:18:01,850 --> 00:18:04,240
Where the water runs out, gold emerges.

401
00:18:10,230 --> 00:18:12,960
There are 3 mines in total
on Mount Ping East Road.

402
00:18:13,120 --> 00:18:14,400
Two tin mines

403
00:18:14,450 --> 00:18:15,580
and one copper mine.

404
00:18:16,230 --> 00:18:17,510
The mines you found

405
00:18:17,770 --> 00:18:19,430
are indeed east of Mount Ping,

406
00:18:19,510 --> 00:18:21,200
but they are all on the south bank
of the Hao River.

407
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:22,880
This is different from
what Master Song said.

408
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:24,010
Because that old man

409
00:18:24,070 --> 00:18:25,600
was just talking nonsense.

410
00:18:25,750 --> 00:18:26,750
See for yourself.

411
00:18:27,190 --> 00:18:29,450
There are no mines north of the Hao River.

412
00:18:32,790 --> 00:18:33,360
Then...

413
00:18:34,600 --> 00:18:35,530
what about here?

414
00:18:35,770 --> 00:18:36,570
This won't do.

415
00:18:36,990 --> 00:18:38,600
This is a famous cursed mine nearby.

416
00:18:38,600 --> 00:18:40,310
There have been many accidents.

417
00:18:40,310 --> 00:18:42,290
This mine has changed hands several times.

418
00:18:42,290 --> 00:18:43,370
It's completely abandoned now.

419
00:18:43,370 --> 00:18:45,230
No one would take it even for free.

420
00:18:45,310 --> 00:18:46,400
I didn't expect

421
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:48,070
you to know so much.

422
00:18:49,410 --> 00:18:51,610
Even though my daddy and I always argue,

423
00:18:52,230 --> 00:18:53,310
locating ore veins
and pinpointing deposits

424
00:18:53,310 --> 00:18:54,700
is our family's ancestral craft,

425
00:18:54,700 --> 00:18:57,230
and he has been teaching me
since I was a child.

426
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:02,570
Then can you

427
00:19:03,040 --> 00:19:04,600
go take a look here with me?

428
00:19:13,440 --> 00:19:14,750
I was right, wasn't I?

429
00:19:15,130 --> 00:19:16,200
Look at this mine.

430
00:19:16,230 --> 00:19:18,360
It's been abandoned for so many years.

431
00:19:21,240 --> 00:19:23,370
Let's go inside and take another look.

432
00:19:47,600 --> 00:19:48,560
Come look.

433
00:19:49,730 --> 00:19:50,360
We've already

434
00:19:50,360 --> 00:19:51,750
gone down that deep,

435
00:19:51,750 --> 00:19:53,120
and it's still just rock walls.

436
00:19:53,120 --> 00:19:54,030
This means

437
00:19:54,070 --> 00:19:56,400
this mine is almost completely mined out.

438
00:19:56,440 --> 00:19:57,440
So if you ask me,

439
00:19:57,710 --> 00:19:59,060
even if this isn't a cursed mine,

440
00:19:59,060 --> 00:20:01,190
there's no need for you to invest in it.

441
00:20:01,430 --> 00:20:04,040
But Master Song
can't be wrong in his divination.

442
00:20:04,040 --> 00:20:05,510
Then let him go down with you.

443
00:20:05,510 --> 00:20:06,400
I'm done.

444
00:20:06,810 --> 00:20:07,670
Wait a minute.

445
00:20:09,270 --> 00:20:10,560
Have you heard

446
00:20:11,270 --> 00:20:12,360
that sound?

447
00:20:36,350 --> 00:20:37,320
It's fine.

448
00:20:38,160 --> 00:20:39,220
They all flew away.

449
00:20:54,510 --> 00:20:55,230
Who is it?

450
00:20:56,310 --> 00:20:57,120
Who's there?

451
00:20:58,320 --> 00:20:59,270
You scared me.

452
00:21:01,590 --> 00:21:03,790
What are you two doing in my mine?

453
00:21:05,990 --> 00:21:06,600
Mr. Hu,

454
00:21:06,960 --> 00:21:07,640
how much

455
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:09,550
are you planning
to sell this tin mine for?

456
00:21:09,550 --> 00:21:10,960
If you sincerely want it,

457
00:21:11,340 --> 00:21:13,000
I'll give you one fixed price.

458
00:21:14,470 --> 00:21:15,140
Ten thousand.

459
00:21:15,140 --> 00:21:15,670
How much?

460
00:21:15,840 --> 00:21:16,400
Ten thousand.

461
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:17,510
Are you crazy?

462
00:21:17,680 --> 00:21:19,990
Even owners of rich mines
only ask for this price.

463
00:21:19,990 --> 00:21:21,990
Your mine is almost dug dry,

464
00:21:21,990 --> 00:21:23,640
and it's been abandoned for so many years.

465
00:21:23,640 --> 00:21:25,500
Why are you asking for this price?

466
00:21:26,140 --> 00:21:28,220
I think this girl makes sense.

467
00:21:28,360 --> 00:21:29,890
Then let's leave it at that.

468
00:21:30,020 --> 00:21:31,420
I'm not selling the mine.

469
00:21:31,760 --> 00:21:32,560
Wait a minute.

470
00:21:50,920 --> 00:21:51,710
Mr. Hu.

471
00:21:52,470 --> 00:21:54,480
This is a check
from Standard Chartered Bank.

472
00:21:54,480 --> 00:21:55,570
Sign the contract,

473
00:21:55,920 --> 00:21:57,230
and you can withdraw the money today.

474
00:21:57,230 --> 00:21:57,920
Okay.

475
00:21:58,000 --> 00:21:58,840
Wait a minute.

476
00:21:59,400 --> 00:22:00,550
Are you crazy too?

477
00:22:01,840 --> 00:22:02,920
I guarantee you,

478
00:22:03,270 --> 00:22:04,510
if you buy this mine,

479
00:22:04,640 --> 00:22:06,700
you'll definitely lose everything.

480
00:22:08,840 --> 00:22:09,750
Don't worry.

481
00:22:10,470 --> 00:22:11,870
I've thought it through.

482
00:22:18,160 --> 00:22:18,840
Mr. Hu.

483
00:22:19,430 --> 00:22:21,760
-To our cooperation
-To our cooperation.

484
00:22:30,130 --> 00:22:33,290
That Hu Guangyuan looked like a profiteer.

485
00:22:33,750 --> 00:22:35,220
Since Shengxiang bought his mine,

486
00:22:35,220 --> 00:22:37,420
he's definitely going to suffer a loss.

487
00:22:38,790 --> 00:22:39,460
Qingying.

488
00:22:40,020 --> 00:22:42,150
Don't you understand by now?

489
00:22:43,510 --> 00:22:44,520
Understand what?

490
00:22:45,200 --> 00:22:46,710
Hu Guangyuan who sells the mine

491
00:22:46,710 --> 00:22:48,270
and Song Tiezui

492
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:50,440
are actually in cahoots.

493
00:22:51,880 --> 00:22:53,160
I even suspect

494
00:22:53,180 --> 00:22:55,790
that Lin Shengxiang
is involved with them too.

495
00:22:56,160 --> 00:22:58,680
The act these people have been putting on
these past few days

496
00:22:58,680 --> 00:23:00,640
is just a scheme against me.

497
00:23:01,210 --> 00:23:02,140
No way.

498
00:23:02,510 --> 00:23:03,910
You're overthinking it.

499
00:23:04,070 --> 00:23:06,440
Because he believed
a fortune teller's words,

500
00:23:06,440 --> 00:23:09,200
he spent 10,000 silver dollars
on an abandoned mine.

501
00:23:09,200 --> 00:23:11,440
This kind of person
is either a complete fool

502
00:23:11,440 --> 00:23:13,440
or a master of some bigger scheme.

503
00:23:13,810 --> 00:23:14,770
Think about it.

504
00:23:15,230 --> 00:23:16,180
From the moment we met,

505
00:23:16,180 --> 00:23:18,460
he kept mentioning Song Tiezui.

506
00:23:18,640 --> 00:23:20,530
It was clearly intentional.

507
00:23:20,840 --> 00:23:21,790
No way.

508
00:23:22,070 --> 00:23:24,550
I actually hope this kid Lin Shengxiang

509
00:23:24,550 --> 00:23:26,400
is a complete fool.

510
00:23:26,880 --> 00:23:27,640
Why?

511
00:23:27,960 --> 00:23:30,510
He spent that much money
on an abandoned mine.

512
00:23:30,710 --> 00:23:31,840
If we do business with him,

513
00:23:31,840 --> 00:23:33,230
we certainly won't take a loss.

514
00:23:33,230 --> 00:23:34,030
Daddy.

515
00:23:35,230 --> 00:23:36,310
Let me tell you,

516
00:23:36,470 --> 00:23:39,070
don't get any ideas
about this Lin Shengxiang.

517
00:23:39,160 --> 00:23:42,120
I will never allow
my son-in-law to be a fool!

518
00:23:43,400 --> 00:23:44,120
Master Hu,

519
00:23:44,550 --> 00:23:45,680
I just feel like

520
00:23:46,030 --> 00:23:46,990
our act

521
00:23:47,680 --> 00:23:48,840
is a bit overdone.

522
00:23:49,200 --> 00:23:49,960
Is that so?

523
00:23:50,680 --> 00:23:51,610
Tell me about it.

524
00:23:52,530 --> 00:23:55,240
Buying such an abandoned mine
for 10,000 silver dollars.

525
00:23:55,240 --> 00:23:57,230
Chen Jiarong has been in business
for so many years.

526
00:23:57,230 --> 00:24:00,490
He will definitely think
there's something wrong with us.

527
00:24:00,600 --> 00:24:01,750
That's not wrong.

528
00:24:02,040 --> 00:24:03,900
There's something wrong with us.

529
00:24:05,680 --> 00:24:07,540
Then how can I make him believe me?

530
00:24:08,790 --> 00:24:09,840
You said it yourself.

531
00:24:09,840 --> 00:24:11,570
He's been in business for so many years.

532
00:24:11,570 --> 00:24:13,120
An old fox like him

533
00:24:13,230 --> 00:24:15,200
will never easily trust anyone.

534
00:24:17,120 --> 00:24:19,120
I'm getting more and more confused.

535
00:24:21,420 --> 00:24:22,500
Remember, kid,

536
00:24:22,680 --> 00:24:24,140
I'm teaching you for free.

537
00:24:25,160 --> 00:24:27,120
When you put in enough effort,

538
00:24:27,640 --> 00:24:28,230
people

539
00:24:28,440 --> 00:24:30,270
will deceive themselves.

540
00:24:30,550 --> 00:24:32,030
So you have to

541
00:24:32,230 --> 00:24:33,710
keep putting on this act.

542
00:24:35,070 --> 00:24:36,470
Hurry up, put some effort into it!

543
00:24:36,470 --> 00:24:36,920
-Got it!
-Got it!

544
00:24:36,920 --> 00:24:38,510
Get that machine running!

545
00:24:39,030 --> 00:24:39,960
Hurry up.

546
00:24:40,230 --> 00:24:41,080
Come on.

547
00:24:41,680 --> 00:24:42,770
Put some effort into it.

548
00:24:42,770 --> 00:24:43,330
Mr. Hu,

549
00:24:43,680 --> 00:24:44,480
they're here.

550
00:24:46,200 --> 00:24:46,890
Mr. Lin.

551
00:24:46,950 --> 00:24:47,520
Come,

552
00:24:47,540 --> 00:24:48,400
please come in.

553
00:24:49,200 --> 00:24:50,200
Come, Mr. Lin.

554
00:24:50,230 --> 00:24:51,490
Come in and have a seat.

555
00:24:53,790 --> 00:24:54,680
Mr. Hu,

556
00:24:54,880 --> 00:24:57,030
we're officially taking over
the tin mine tomorrow.

557
00:24:57,030 --> 00:24:58,360
What do you mean

558
00:24:58,680 --> 00:25:00,080
by calling us here today?

559
00:25:00,310 --> 00:25:01,380
No rush.

560
00:25:01,710 --> 00:25:02,640
Sit down and rest for a while.

561
00:25:02,640 --> 00:25:04,730
Have some water, and let's take our time.

562
00:25:04,730 --> 00:25:06,290
No need to be so polite with us.

563
00:25:06,290 --> 00:25:07,320
If you have something to say,

564
00:25:07,320 --> 00:25:08,320
just say it.

565
00:25:09,200 --> 00:25:09,990
Alright.

566
00:25:10,070 --> 00:25:12,270
Then I'll be straightforward, Mr. Lin.

567
00:25:12,270 --> 00:25:13,470
I don't want to sell

568
00:25:13,960 --> 00:25:15,020
this mine anymore.

569
00:25:17,230 --> 00:25:18,440
What are you talking about?

570
00:25:18,440 --> 00:25:19,600
The contract has been signed,

571
00:25:19,600 --> 00:25:20,400
and the money has been paid.

572
00:25:20,400 --> 00:25:21,350
Are you backing out now?

573
00:25:21,350 --> 00:25:24,350
I will refund every penny to you,

574
00:25:24,530 --> 00:25:25,600
but the contract

575
00:25:25,920 --> 00:25:26,400
is void.

576
00:25:26,400 --> 00:25:27,510
Are you kidding me?

577
00:25:27,510 --> 00:25:28,240
Shengxiang,

578
00:25:28,690 --> 00:25:30,580
let's hear Mr. Hu out first.

579
00:25:30,840 --> 00:25:32,200
I'm very sorry,

580
00:25:32,320 --> 00:25:33,080
Mr. Lin.

581
00:25:33,360 --> 00:25:35,790
You gave me a check
for 10,000 silver dollars.

582
00:25:35,790 --> 00:25:37,880
I'm returning it to you untouched.

583
00:25:38,070 --> 00:25:39,440
As an apology,

584
00:25:39,680 --> 00:25:40,360
I am

585
00:25:41,030 --> 00:25:41,840
adding

586
00:25:41,960 --> 00:25:44,030
2,000 silver dollars in cash.

587
00:25:44,120 --> 00:25:45,550
Here is your check.

588
00:25:45,790 --> 00:25:48,110
A total of 12,000 silver dollars.

589
00:25:48,400 --> 00:25:49,860
Think about it carefully.

590
00:25:49,920 --> 00:25:50,640
Mr. Hu,

591
00:25:51,030 --> 00:25:52,470
tell me the truth.

592
00:25:52,680 --> 00:25:53,920
What exactly happened

593
00:25:53,920 --> 00:25:55,360
with your tin mine?

594
00:25:55,470 --> 00:25:57,880
Nothing happened.

595
00:25:57,900 --> 00:25:59,880
I just don't want to sell it anymore.

596
00:25:59,880 --> 00:26:00,790
Mr. Lin,

597
00:26:00,960 --> 00:26:02,360
take the 12,000 silver dollars

598
00:26:02,360 --> 00:26:04,030
and leave.

599
00:26:04,230 --> 00:26:04,960
Impossible!

600
00:26:04,990 --> 00:26:05,990
The contract has been signed.

601
00:26:05,990 --> 00:26:07,850
You can't just back out like that.

602
00:26:09,400 --> 00:26:10,990
Then I'll tell you.

603
00:26:11,160 --> 00:26:13,400
This is my territory.

604
00:26:13,680 --> 00:26:15,200
I can back out

605
00:26:15,220 --> 00:26:17,110
if I want to.

606
00:26:18,030 --> 00:26:18,680
Men!

607
00:26:19,920 --> 00:26:20,790
Come here!

608
00:26:20,850 --> 00:26:21,610
Hurry up!

609
00:26:24,640 --> 00:26:25,380
Are you scared?

610
00:26:25,380 --> 00:26:26,540
Can you take them?

611
00:26:26,670 --> 00:26:27,430
Shengxiang,

612
00:26:27,910 --> 00:26:28,550
let's go.

613
00:26:29,290 --> 00:26:29,920
Go.

614
00:26:33,120 --> 00:26:34,120
Mr. Lin,

615
00:26:34,120 --> 00:26:37,120
even if you don't take the money,
the contract is void.

616
00:26:41,980 --> 00:26:43,180
Not selling anymore?

617
00:26:46,230 --> 00:26:47,120
Why?

618
00:26:47,320 --> 00:26:48,470
He didn't say why.

619
00:26:48,710 --> 00:26:50,510
He even paid another 2,000 silver dollars

620
00:26:50,510 --> 00:26:51,570
to Lin Shengxiang,

621
00:26:51,960 --> 00:26:54,360
as long as he agreed
to cancel the contract.

622
00:26:56,120 --> 00:26:57,070
Did he agree?

623
00:26:57,310 --> 00:26:57,990
No.

624
00:26:58,100 --> 00:26:59,510
They almost got into a fight.

625
00:26:59,510 --> 00:27:01,640
A group of miners surrounded them.

626
00:27:04,030 --> 00:27:05,160
Send some men

627
00:27:05,160 --> 00:27:06,920
to ask around Mount Ping

628
00:27:07,230 --> 00:27:08,960
and see what's been going on

629
00:27:09,840 --> 00:27:11,470
at Hu's mine recently.

630
00:27:11,710 --> 00:27:12,400
Yes, Master.

631
00:27:12,400 --> 00:27:13,460
I'll go right away.

632
00:27:14,160 --> 00:27:15,840
I heard from Gui recently

633
00:27:16,440 --> 00:27:17,840
that you kept going out

634
00:27:18,230 --> 00:27:20,290
and were gone for a long time once out.

635
00:27:20,470 --> 00:27:21,600
What were you doing?

636
00:27:21,840 --> 00:27:23,070
The Pangzhou Jockey Club

637
00:27:23,070 --> 00:27:24,120
got a new horse.

638
00:27:24,440 --> 00:27:27,100
They said it's some famous
British royal horse.

639
00:27:27,360 --> 00:27:28,600
I got carried away

640
00:27:28,740 --> 00:27:30,140
and bet on 5 races in a row.

641
00:27:32,750 --> 00:27:34,400
You didn't win a single one.

642
00:27:34,420 --> 00:27:36,290
I even owe a loan shark
100 silver dollars.

643
00:27:36,290 --> 00:27:38,330
But he saw me in the newspaper,

644
00:27:38,590 --> 00:27:40,920
so he didn't make me leave any collateral.

645
00:27:43,360 --> 00:27:44,030
Master Hu,

646
00:27:44,640 --> 00:27:45,920
about my money,

647
00:27:46,200 --> 00:27:47,530
is it convenient for you

648
00:27:47,640 --> 00:27:48,770
to pay me in advance?

649
00:27:50,840 --> 00:27:52,750
You really think
you're a rich young master, don't you?

650
00:27:52,750 --> 00:27:54,350
It's normal for the son
of a Chinese tycoon

651
00:27:54,350 --> 00:27:56,180
to have some entertainment, isn't it?

652
00:27:56,180 --> 00:27:58,110
You are right, Mr. Lin.

653
00:27:58,230 --> 00:28:00,640
But the rule of the Tianxiang Sect

654
00:28:00,990 --> 00:28:02,400
is to settle the bill
after the job is done.

655
00:28:02,400 --> 00:28:03,570
No delays.

656
00:28:03,880 --> 00:28:05,120
As for advances,

657
00:28:05,160 --> 00:28:06,550
don't even ask.

658
00:28:08,160 --> 00:28:09,020
How about this?

659
00:28:10,030 --> 00:28:11,840
You play this last scene well,

660
00:28:12,510 --> 00:28:13,360
and I'll have Gui

661
00:28:13,360 --> 00:28:15,360
take you out for some fun.

662
00:28:16,030 --> 00:28:16,790
That works.

663
00:28:23,550 --> 00:28:24,200
Master,

664
00:28:24,550 --> 00:28:26,310
I thought of finding one of our own

665
00:28:26,310 --> 00:28:27,360
to disguise as a miner

666
00:28:27,360 --> 00:28:29,070
to ask around at Hu's mine.

667
00:28:29,230 --> 00:28:30,810
But when we got there, we found out

668
00:28:30,810 --> 00:28:32,340
they were no longer hiring.

669
00:28:32,360 --> 00:28:33,600
Then spend some money

670
00:28:33,910 --> 00:28:36,470
to buy off their miners
to scout the interior.

671
00:28:36,920 --> 00:28:39,710
I've already sent capable people
to investigate.

672
00:28:39,710 --> 00:28:40,790
He said the Hu family's mine

673
00:28:40,790 --> 00:28:42,850
started recruiting half a month ago.

674
00:28:42,960 --> 00:28:44,510
It's a famously poor-grade mine,

675
00:28:44,510 --> 00:28:46,310
so no one wanted to go at first.

676
00:28:46,600 --> 00:28:47,790
Later, Hu said

677
00:28:47,810 --> 00:28:49,670
he would add half a month's wages,

678
00:28:49,730 --> 00:28:51,200
and that's how he recruited some people.

679
00:28:51,200 --> 00:28:51,960
He wanted

680
00:28:51,960 --> 00:28:55,420
to dig up some more tin ore
and make a fortune before selling it.

681
00:28:57,490 --> 00:28:59,620
Then why did he stop selling it later?

682
00:28:59,920 --> 00:29:01,160
That miner said

683
00:29:01,230 --> 00:29:03,440
they worked overtime last night
and went down the mine.

684
00:29:03,440 --> 00:29:04,700
He saw with his own eyes

685
00:29:04,750 --> 00:29:07,080
that they dug up some things
from the mine,

686
00:29:07,200 --> 00:29:07,750
and

687
00:29:07,990 --> 00:29:09,650
in considerable quantities.

688
00:29:10,490 --> 00:29:11,540
What things?

689
00:29:16,880 --> 00:29:17,640
Uncle?

690
00:29:18,270 --> 00:29:19,200
Why are you here?

691
00:29:26,380 --> 00:29:28,620
That guy named Song was right.

692
00:29:28,790 --> 00:29:29,960
Where the mountain ends, silver appears.

693
00:29:29,960 --> 00:29:31,470
Where the water runs out, gold emerges.

694
00:29:31,470 --> 00:29:32,510
Hu's mine

695
00:29:32,680 --> 00:29:33,750
has produced gold!

696
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:45,920
Men,

697
00:29:45,950 --> 00:29:47,190
grab your weapons!

698
00:29:56,750 --> 00:29:57,750
Mr. Chen,

699
00:29:58,440 --> 00:29:59,230
Mr. Lin,

700
00:29:59,470 --> 00:30:00,200
what are you doing?

701
00:30:00,200 --> 00:30:01,120
We agreed

702
00:30:01,790 --> 00:30:03,520
to take over the tin mine today.

703
00:30:08,110 --> 00:30:09,660
Mr. Chen, have some tea.

704
00:30:10,920 --> 00:30:11,640
Mr. Lin.

705
00:30:15,790 --> 00:30:16,710
Mr. Lin,

706
00:30:17,030 --> 00:30:17,990
before,

707
00:30:18,230 --> 00:30:19,360
it was my fault

708
00:30:19,710 --> 00:30:21,360
for selling you a poor‑grade mine

709
00:30:21,360 --> 00:30:22,960
for so little money.

710
00:30:23,160 --> 00:30:26,510
I'd been feeling uneasy
since I went back.

711
00:30:26,840 --> 00:30:28,640
You can't let me

712
00:30:28,640 --> 00:30:30,370
live the rest of my life in guilt

713
00:30:30,400 --> 00:30:33,200
and be forever tormented
by my conscience, right?

714
00:30:33,200 --> 00:30:34,230
I really

715
00:30:34,510 --> 00:30:36,510
can't sell this mine to you.

716
00:30:37,230 --> 00:30:38,120
Mr. Hu,

717
00:30:38,880 --> 00:30:40,550
what do you mean?

718
00:30:40,790 --> 00:30:41,600
Mr. Chen,

719
00:30:41,920 --> 00:30:43,710
didn't I just say it?

720
00:30:44,710 --> 00:30:46,030
It's a poor-grade mine.

721
00:30:46,030 --> 00:30:47,510
The tin is gone.

722
00:30:47,840 --> 00:30:49,310
I dug it all up.

723
00:30:49,470 --> 00:30:51,680
If Mr. Lin takes over this mine,

724
00:30:51,790 --> 00:30:54,640
he will lose everything.

725
00:30:54,840 --> 00:30:55,900
It doesn't matter.

726
00:30:55,960 --> 00:30:57,470
I've already spent the money.

727
00:30:57,470 --> 00:30:58,930
Even if I lose everything,

728
00:30:58,960 --> 00:31:00,220
I will never blame you.

729
00:31:03,840 --> 00:31:04,470
Master.

730
00:31:07,120 --> 00:31:09,160
Can't you see I'm talking
to the two bosses?

731
00:31:09,160 --> 00:31:09,640
Leave!

732
00:31:09,980 --> 00:31:10,740
Stop!

733
00:31:16,840 --> 00:31:17,880
Wait, Mr. Chen,

734
00:31:18,030 --> 00:31:18,440
Young Master Lin,

735
00:31:18,440 --> 00:31:19,500
what are you doing?

736
00:31:19,950 --> 00:31:20,950
What are we doing?

737
00:31:21,400 --> 00:31:22,530
Still playing dumb?

738
00:31:23,310 --> 00:31:25,710
Don't you know what was dug up

739
00:31:25,730 --> 00:31:27,160
in Young Master Lin's mine?

740
00:31:27,160 --> 00:31:27,890
Shengxiang.

741
00:31:28,160 --> 00:31:29,490
Wait, Young Master Lin.

742
00:31:41,070 --> 00:31:41,800
As expected.

743
00:31:42,470 --> 00:31:43,400
Where the mountain ends, silver appears.

744
00:31:43,400 --> 00:31:44,680
Where the water runs out, gold emerges.

745
00:31:44,680 --> 00:31:46,340
Whatever it produces is mine!

746
00:31:46,390 --> 00:31:48,320
I'm not selling this mine anymore.

747
00:31:48,400 --> 00:31:48,920
Why?

748
00:31:49,200 --> 00:31:51,270
Are you going to rob me in broad daylight?

749
00:31:51,270 --> 00:31:53,440
It's clearly written in the contract.

750
00:31:53,710 --> 00:31:55,030
If you breach it,

751
00:31:55,440 --> 00:31:57,700
you shall pay 10 times the compensation.

752
00:31:57,920 --> 00:31:58,990
That is...

753
00:31:59,550 --> 00:32:00,950
100,000 silver dollars.

754
00:32:06,310 --> 00:32:08,310
If you want to play hardball,

755
00:32:08,580 --> 00:32:11,790
I'm well‑acquainted with the Sanhe Society
and the Chaozhou Gang.

756
00:32:11,790 --> 00:32:13,990
We can go head‑to‑head.

757
00:32:17,750 --> 00:32:18,600
Shengxiang,

758
00:32:19,270 --> 00:32:20,200
let's go.

759
00:32:26,160 --> 00:32:27,030
Wait a minute.

760
00:32:31,680 --> 00:32:32,360
Mr. Chen,

761
00:32:32,640 --> 00:32:34,600
I know your strength very well,

762
00:32:34,790 --> 00:32:36,270
but I haven't survived

763
00:32:36,270 --> 00:32:37,870
all these years for nothing.

764
00:32:38,600 --> 00:32:39,200
Fine then,

765
00:32:39,400 --> 00:32:40,460
let's be straight.

766
00:32:40,790 --> 00:32:41,440
The tin

767
00:32:41,790 --> 00:32:42,360
is gone.

768
00:32:43,400 --> 00:32:45,930
Who would have thought
it would produce gold?

769
00:32:45,930 --> 00:32:47,930
I don't know how much it can produce,

770
00:32:48,230 --> 00:32:50,120
but judging from the ore vein,

771
00:32:50,510 --> 00:32:53,240
it's at least 200,000
to 300,000 silver dollars.

772
00:32:53,270 --> 00:32:54,440
If you want it,

773
00:32:54,600 --> 00:32:55,660
you must add money!

774
00:32:55,840 --> 00:32:56,710
150,000!

775
00:33:01,750 --> 00:33:03,210
150,000 is not gonna work.

776
00:33:03,600 --> 00:33:04,710
50,000 at most.

777
00:33:04,990 --> 00:33:06,200
If you don't agree,

778
00:33:06,600 --> 00:33:08,630
we can talk in another way.

779
00:33:09,550 --> 00:33:10,080
Let's go.

780
00:33:11,920 --> 00:33:12,640
100,000!

781
00:33:13,360 --> 00:33:14,680
Not a penny less!

782
00:33:23,310 --> 00:33:24,120
Uncle Chen,

783
00:33:24,340 --> 00:33:26,000
thanks for what you did today.

784
00:33:26,160 --> 00:33:26,920
Otherwise,

785
00:33:27,300 --> 00:33:29,430
Hu definitely wouldn't have given in.

786
00:33:31,130 --> 00:33:31,850
Such men

787
00:33:32,400 --> 00:33:33,720
are like hounds;

788
00:33:34,230 --> 00:33:37,310
they will not release their hold
when they catch wind of profit.

789
00:33:37,310 --> 00:33:38,070
You've still

790
00:33:38,270 --> 00:33:39,510
got a lot to learn.

791
00:33:41,070 --> 00:33:41,670
By the way,

792
00:33:42,230 --> 00:33:44,430
I didn't bring that much cash this time.

793
00:33:44,550 --> 00:33:46,070
Do you have a reliable bank

794
00:33:46,070 --> 00:33:47,070
to recommend?

795
00:33:47,990 --> 00:33:49,360
No need to find a bank.

796
00:33:49,790 --> 00:33:50,840
I'll pay for it.

797
00:33:51,310 --> 00:33:54,550
Let's just say
we're partners in this mine.

798
00:33:57,710 --> 00:33:58,270
Why?

799
00:33:59,070 --> 00:34:01,270
Reluctant to part with half the shares?

800
00:34:03,970 --> 00:34:05,170
Without you,

801
00:34:06,130 --> 00:34:08,260
I couldn't have gotten this gold mine.

802
00:34:09,670 --> 00:34:10,730
I'll listen to you.

803
00:34:12,150 --> 00:34:12,750
Fine then.

804
00:34:24,110 --> 00:34:24,969
The act is over.

805
00:34:25,150 --> 00:34:26,350
Where is my grandson?

806
00:34:28,360 --> 00:34:30,219
This is your grandson's address.

807
00:34:32,469 --> 00:34:33,730
Where is Jiang Feiyan?

808
00:34:34,590 --> 00:34:35,800
We set up every scam

809
00:34:35,989 --> 00:34:37,239
using coded signals.

810
00:34:37,989 --> 00:34:39,550
Once it was done, we split up.

811
00:34:39,550 --> 00:34:40,800
No further contact between us.

812
00:34:40,800 --> 00:34:42,400
Who set up the scam back then?

813
00:34:43,360 --> 00:34:44,239
I only know

814
00:34:45,110 --> 00:34:47,110
he was a hall-master-level figure.

815
00:34:47,710 --> 00:34:49,969
What about that blind man from back then?

816
00:34:54,670 --> 00:34:55,670
Come, be careful.

817
00:34:57,190 --> 00:34:57,590
Mom.

818
00:34:57,760 --> 00:34:58,360
Mom.

819
00:34:58,840 --> 00:34:59,570
You're back.

820
00:34:59,880 --> 00:35:00,920
We have a guest.

821
00:35:02,280 --> 00:35:03,110
This is Mr. Du,

822
00:35:03,130 --> 00:35:04,660
I told you about last time.

823
00:35:06,720 --> 00:35:08,380
The one who told your fortune?

824
00:35:08,920 --> 00:35:09,840
Mr. Du

825
00:35:10,110 --> 00:35:12,240
has come to our parts on his wanderings,

826
00:35:12,240 --> 00:35:13,040
so he came over

827
00:35:13,190 --> 00:35:15,190
to check on my old illness again.

828
00:35:16,550 --> 00:35:18,030
Can he even practice medicine?

829
00:35:18,030 --> 00:35:19,150
Yet he's taking your pulse.

830
00:35:19,150 --> 00:35:20,320
You can't say that.

831
00:35:20,470 --> 00:35:22,840
Mr. Du is a reincarnated immortal.

832
00:35:23,880 --> 00:35:26,550
I took Mr. Du's prescription before.

833
00:35:26,960 --> 00:35:27,990
At that time, my health

834
00:35:27,990 --> 00:35:29,240
improved a lot.

835
00:35:29,470 --> 00:35:31,720
Mountain, medicine, destiny,
physiognomy, and divination.

836
00:35:31,720 --> 00:35:32,920
In our line of work,

837
00:35:33,130 --> 00:35:36,070
we naturally need to know
some basic medical knowledge.

838
00:35:36,070 --> 00:35:37,670
Just tell me the truth.

839
00:35:38,590 --> 00:35:40,590
When you usually read
people's Four Pillars chart,

840
00:35:40,590 --> 00:35:42,470
do you just talk nonsense?

841
00:35:42,760 --> 00:35:43,880
You are mistaken.

842
00:35:45,030 --> 00:35:46,550
The so-called Four Pillars chart

843
00:35:46,550 --> 00:35:48,150
is just a person's birthday.

844
00:35:48,550 --> 00:35:50,080
Year, month, day, and time.

845
00:35:50,360 --> 00:35:52,030
Four pairs of Heavenly Stems
and Earthly Branches.

846
00:35:52,030 --> 00:35:53,360
Two characters per set,

847
00:35:53,470 --> 00:35:54,730
8 characters in total.

848
00:35:54,840 --> 00:35:56,240
Hence, it's called Bazi,

849
00:35:56,510 --> 00:35:58,240
also known as the Four Pillars.

850
00:35:58,670 --> 00:35:59,510
Nonsense.

851
00:35:59,840 --> 00:36:00,900
Then let me ask you.

852
00:36:00,990 --> 00:36:03,050
If two people have the same birthday,

853
00:36:03,150 --> 00:36:04,080
is their destiny

854
00:36:04,360 --> 00:36:05,470
the same too?

855
00:36:05,600 --> 00:36:06,830
Of course not.

856
00:36:07,440 --> 00:36:10,280
If we further refine each Hour Pillar,

857
00:36:10,510 --> 00:36:12,310
down to every quarter of an hour,

858
00:36:12,590 --> 00:36:15,240
