1002
00:43:03,030 --> 00:43:03,720
Let them go.

1003
00:43:03,960 --> 00:43:04,620
Let them go.

1004
00:43:04,960 --> 00:43:05,620
I am guilty.

1005
00:43:06,090 --> 00:43:06,800
I am guilty.

1006
00:43:07,030 --> 00:43:08,670
I originally thought

1007
00:43:08,670 --> 00:43:11,760
