1014
00:43:24,880 --> 00:43:26,950
Their souls are naturally not here.

1015
00:43:27,320 --> 00:43:28,360
Then where are they?

1016
00:43:28,360 --> 00:43:30,550
The Southern Immortal Elder
wants to take them

1017
00:43:30,550 --> 00:43:31,810
