1018
00:43:31,920 --> 00:43:34,110
How can we mortals stop it?

1019
00:43:34,440 --> 00:43:35,190
No way.

1020
00:43:36,240 --> 00:43:37,110
No way.

1021
00:43:37,110 --> 00:43:37,840
No way.

1022
